 - `GET /health` runs `SELECT 1` and returns JSON `{ok, db}` with 200 or 503.
 - `GET /ready` also requires an HTTPS `BETTER_AUTH_URL` when the process looks hosted (non-loopback `DATABASE_URL` or `GROK_PROJECT_ID`) and reports `signupOpen` plus `mcpSetupUi`.
 - DigitalOcean pilot: `startup-production.sh` defaults `CHAPELGATE_MCP_SETUP_UI=false`; `/ready.mcpSetupUi` must be `false`. MCP Bearer tokens are a **separate host privilege plane** (see [CONTROL_MCP.md](./docs/CONTROL_MCP.md)) — not wallet org sessions; rotate/CLI/audit never log the raw token.
 - Neither endpoint returns connection strings or secrets. `GET /` is marketing and is not a liveness probe.
-- Responses include `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`, `Referrer-Policy: no-referrer`, `Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin`, `Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin`, `Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains`, `X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow`, and `Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), bluetooth=(), midi=(), serial=(), hid=(), display-capture=(), window-management=(), xr-spatial-tracking=(), clipboard-read=(), clipboard-write=(), accelerometer=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), ambient-light-sensor=(), screen-wake-lock=(), idle-detection=(), picture-in-picture=(), autoplay=(), encrypted-media=(), fullscreen=(), web-share=(), sync-xhr=(), battery=(), gamepad=(), local-fonts=(), speaker-selection=(), storage-access=(), top-level-storage-access=(), otp-credentials=(), cross-origin-isolated=(), document-domain=(), view-transition=(), identity-credentials-get=(), execution-while-out-of-viewport=(), execution-while-not-rendered=(), browsing-topics=(), shared-storage=(), attribution-reporting=(), private-state-token-issuance=(), private-state-token-redemption=(), publickey-credentials-create=(), publickey-credentials-get=(), compute-pressure=(), keyboard-map=(), unload=(), interest-cohort=(), join-ad-interest-group=(), run-ad-auction=(), private-aggregation=(), shared-storage-select-url=(), ch-ua-high-entropy-values=(), trust-token-redemption=(), conversion-measurement=(), vertical-scroll=(), sync-script=(), ch-ua-arch=(), ch-ua-bitness=(), ch-ua-full-version=(), ch-ua-platform=(), ch-ua-mobile=(), ch-ua-model=(), ch-ua-wow64=(), ch-viewport-height=(), ch-viewport-width=(), ch-dpr=(), ch-device-memory=(), ch-prefers-reduced-motion=(), ch-save-data=(), document-write=(), xr=(), focus-without-user-activation=(), navigation-override=(), ch-ua-full-version-list=(), ch-ua-platform-version=(), ch-prefers-color-scheme=(), ch-width=(), ch-rtt=(), ch-downlink=(), ch-ect=(), layout-animations=(), legacy-ima